{"id":"038265ef-4dcc-5b17-9003-83c716c14876","title":"导出与分享","icon":"📤","cover":"none","parentId":"22aa57a1-9d74-5c5a-9c04-4fc999c8b9b4","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:08.787Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:08.787Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"导出与分享","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"HTML · 网站 · 会话片段","title":"交给没装 ShowAI 的人","lead":"把页面交给没有安装 ShowAI 的人：一个能离线打开的 HTML 文件、一个可以部署的静态网站，或者一段在 Agent 对话里直接显示的片段。交互随页面一起带走，源文件留着以后继续编辑。","facts":[{"label":"单页","value":"HTML · 会话片段"},{"label":"多页","value":"静态网站"},{"label":"再编辑","value":".showai.json 源文件"}],"art":"collab"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-35ce70ec"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-36ce727f"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"选一种交付方式"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":[{"id":"html","label":"独立 HTML","sub":"默认推荐","tone":"brand"},{"id":"online","label":"在线网页","sub":"联网加载阅读器","tone":"violet"},{"id":"inline","label":"会话片段","sub":"inline","tone":"teal"},{"id":"site","label":"静态网站","sub":"整个项目","tone":"warm"},{"id":"json","label":"源文件","sub":".showai.json","tone":"slate"}],"rows":[{"label":"适合","values":{"html":"分享单页、离线阅读、归档","online":"需要很小的文件，读者能联网","inline":"在支持 HTML 展示的 Agent 对话里预览","site":"多页内容，带导航，放到网址上","json":"以后重新导入、继续编辑"}},{"label":"得到的文件","values":{"html":".html + 同名 .showai.json","online":".html + 同名 .showai.json","inline":"HTML 片段 + 同名 .showai.json","site":"一个目录","json":".showai.json"}},{"label":"保留交互","values":{"html":true,"online":true,"inline":true,"site":true,"json":false}},{"label":"离线打开","values":{"html":true,"online":false,"inline":"由对话宿主显示","site":"需通过 HTTP 访问","json":false}},{"label":"只导出部分内容","hint":"选中的区块及其必要的外层容器","values":{"html":true,"online":true,"inline":true,"site":false,"json":false}},{"label":"体积上限","values":{"html":"256 MiB","online":"只含页面数据，很小","inline":"1 MB（压缩后）","site":"每页 256 MiB","json":"256 MiB"}}],"highlight":"html","note":"HTML、在线网页和会话片段都会在旁边写一份同名 `.showai.json`。它是完整、可编辑的源文件，用项目顶部的「导入」即可重新打开。"},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-37ce7412"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-38ce75a5"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出一个页面"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"打开页面，点顶部的「导出页面」","body":"按钮在页面标题栏右侧（↗ 图标）。导出前会先保存当前修改。","result":"选择保存位置后，得到一个离线 HTML 和同名 `.showai.json`。"},{"title":"需要其他形式时，打开「页面操作」","body":"点标题栏最右侧的 …，菜单里有更多导出方式，见下表。"},{"title":"检查后再发出去","body":"直接用浏览器打开 HTML，看图表、折叠内容和组件交互是否正常，再发给读者。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-31ce6aa0"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"入口"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-381e9534"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2925602b"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"得到什么"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3de5283f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-28255e98"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4667c8ac"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出页面（标题栏 ↗）"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-290eab7"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-83fd3500"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"离线 HTML，按页面原有的空间排布显示，组件全部打包在文件里"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5d68bf8c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-84fd3693"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4767ca3f"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出阅读网页"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f331699a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7fc38855"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"离线 HTML，按阅读顺序重新排成文档样式，窄屏上更好读"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-78596265"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7ec386c2"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4867cbd2"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出在线网页 · 联网加载阅读器"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-db22d75d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f9fc2bca"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"很小的 HTML，阅读器从 CDN 加载，读者需要联网"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-35faac32"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fafc2d5d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4967cd65"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出会话片段"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cc063b48"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fdc67197"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"给 Agent 对话显示用的 HTML 片段，压缩后不超过 1 MB"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-512e3413"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fcc67004"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4267c260"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"引用已发布组件导出"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-14ec73eb"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-589e466c"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"HTML 中的自定义组件按发布网址联网加载并校验，需要先完成组件发布"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6fc448c0"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-599e47ff"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4367c3f3"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下载源文件"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6a78b0e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5414e7e1"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"只导出 "},{"type":"text","text":".showai.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c1e6c39"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5314e64e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4467c586"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-32ce6c33"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🖼️","tone":"sand","id":"node-33ce6dc6"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"页面里的图片、视频、PDF 等资源如果是外部链接，导出会停止并提示有多少个资源需要内嵌。把文件上传到页面里（本地文件随页面保存）后再导出。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-41de6a21"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-34ce6f59"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"把整个项目导出成网站"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"打开项目，点顶部的「导出网站」","body":"按钮在项目页面列表上方。菜单里有两种方式：**离线网站 · 打包组件**，组件随网站打包，部署后不依赖其他网址，大多数情况选它；**联网网站 · 引用发布组件**，自定义组件从已发布的固定版本网址加载，读者需要联网。"},{"title":"选择一个输出目录","body":"导出的是项目中所有未归档的页面。选一个空目录；也可以选之前为同一项目导出的网站目录，会按它的清单更新并删除已不存在的页面。其他非空目录会被拒绝。","result":"提示「网站已导出，可部署到静态托管」。"},{"title":"部署或本地预览","body":"把整个目录上传到任意静态托管。本地查看时用一个 HTTP 服务打开目录，不要直接双击文件——网站的页面共用 `assets/` 下的阅读器。","code":"cd site && python3 -m http.server 8000","lang":"sh"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-3dce7d84"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-tree","version":"1.0.0","props":{"caption":"导出的网站目录","initial":"site/index.html","nodes":[{"name":"site","kind":"dir","open":true,"summary":"可以整体部署到静态托管的目录。","children":[{"name":"index.html","kind":"file","badge":"首页","summary":"项目的第一个页面。","detail":"项目有多个页面时，每页顶部都有一行导航链接，当前页加粗。打印时导航隐藏。"},{"name":"<页面 ID>.html","kind":"file","summary":"其余每个页面各一个 HTML。","detail":"页面数据嵌在各自的 HTML 中，阅读器代码和样式共享。"},{"name":"assets","kind":"dir","open":true,"summary":"所有页面共用的阅读器。","children":[{"name":"viewer.js","kind":"file","summary":"阅读器代码，只包含这些页面用到的组件。"},{"name":"viewer.css","kind":"file","summary":"阅读器样式与站点导航样式。"}]},{"name":"sources","kind":"dir","summary":"每个页面的可编辑源文件。","children":[{"name":"<页面 ID>.showai.json","kind":"file","summary":"可以重新导入工作台继续编辑。"}]},{"name":"showai-site.json","kind":"file","badge":"清单","summary":"网站清单：项目、页面路由、组件交付方式、是否需要联网。","detail":"再次导出到同一目录时依据它更新，并删除已不存在的页面文件。","example":"{\n  \"format\": \"showai-site\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"projectId\": \"…\",\n  \"pages\": [{ \"id\": \"…\", \"title\": \"…\", \"file\": \"index.html\" }],\n  \"components\": \"bundled\",\n  \"requiresNetwork\": false\n}","exampleLang":"json"}]}]},"integrity":"sha256-74d9519ab11b450f4d2feec3813ad0e0d8a26b3d1c93510a74c9a765e1578215"},"id":"node-3ece7f17"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-95fdf25d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"读者打开后能做什么"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"读者不需要安装 ShowAI。导出的网页保留 Page 阅读、Board 浏览和逐层展开；图表提示、折叠内容、导图、流程图和组件里的本地计算都能继续使用。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-94fdf0ca"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"右上角的「页面选项」","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：下载源文件、切换深色或浅色外观、打印。打印时嵌入的 Board 保留空间关系并适配纸张宽度。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fec3eaaf"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5548cc68"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"阅读时的操作不会写回","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：读者可以临时探索组件，但不会改变文件内容。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f99b2864"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5648cdfb"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"仍然需要网络的部分","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：外部来源链接、在线网页的阅读器、引用已发布组件的页面。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d5119779"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5748cf8e"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"阅读锁","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：在本地文件中可以照常切换；浏览器不允许保存状态时，图标会提示保存失败，切换只在本次有效。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cf9ab64e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5848d121"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-93fdef37"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-92fdeda4"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"让 Agent 交付"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用 Agent 写页面时，你通常不需要自己导出。Agent 保存页面后调用 "},{"type":"text","text":"page_present","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，按对话宿主的能力显示整页或选中的部分，并给出完整 HTML 的位置。对话片段超过 1 MB 时，Agent 会挑选能独立理解的区块显示，同时保留完整页面的链接。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-91fdec11"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"脚本和运维场景可以直接用 CLI。命令里的 "},{"type":"text","text":"showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 指已核实的运行时命令前缀，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"CLI 与 MCP 参考","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cli"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-90fdea7e"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-commands","version":"1.0.0","props":{"placeholder":"搜索导出命令或选项","groups":[{"id":"export","label":"导出"},{"id":"publish","label":"组件发布"}],"commands":[{"group":"export","command":"showai export --project PROJECT --page PAGE --format html --out ./report.html --json","summary":"导出离线 HTML 和同名源文件","flags":[{"flag":"--presentation reading","meaning":"按阅读顺序呈现；默认 spatial 保留空间排布"},{"flag":"--reader cdn","meaning":"写成从 CDN 加载阅读器的小体积在线网页"},{"flag":"--components remote","meaning":"自定义组件引用已发布并校验过的版本"},{"flag":"--overwrite","meaning":"允许覆盖已存在的输出文件"}]},{"group":"export","command":"showai export --project PROJECT --page PAGE --format inline --out ./report-inline.html --json","summary":"导出会话片段","detail":"片段必须打包组件。压缩后超过 1 MB 且运行时带有 CDN 阅读器时，会改为联网加载阅读器的片段；否则报告实际字节数，请改为导出选中的区块。"},{"group":"export","command":"showai export --project PROJECT --page PAGE --blocks ID,ID --format inline --out ./part.html --json","summary":"只导出选中的区块","detail":"ID 是页面节点的 `attrs.id`。选中的区域带上其后代和必要的外层容器；局部导出默认按阅读顺序呈现并隐藏页面标题。局部源文件不能用来覆盖原页面。"},{"group":"export","command":"showai export --project PROJECT --format site --out ./site --json","summary":"把项目导出为静态网站","flags":[{"flag":"--components remote","meaning":"联网网站：组件引用已发布版本"}],"detail":"网站导出不支持 `--blocks`，也不支持 CDN 阅读器。"},{"group":"publish","command":"showai publish prepare --project PROJECT --input publication-refs.json --out ./publication --json","summary":"准备组件发布文件（只写本地）"},{"group":"publish","command":"showai publish verify --project PROJECT --url MANIFEST_URL --json","summary":"从实际网址下载并校验，登记到已发布目录","detail":"`publish register` 是同一操作的别名。"},{"group":"publish","command":"showai publish list --limit 20 --json","summary":"列出已校验的发布"}]},"integrity":"sha256-f2cb922c18c3fa9d4f1aab66332746643bedee46148b4975f3ca1e16a32d3f52"},"id":"node-8ffde8eb"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-8efde758"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"发布组件，让网页联网加载"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"默认的打包导出最省心。只有当你希望多份网页共用同一份已发布的组件、让文件更小时，才需要发布。发布是一条由你掌控的链路：ShowAI 准备文件和校验，上传由你完成。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8dfde5c5"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-sequence","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"从准备发布到读者打开","actors":[{"id":"you","label":"你或 Agent","icon":"🧑‍💻","tone":"slate"},{"id":"showai","label":"ShowAI","tone":"brand"},{"id":"host","label":"静态托管","tone":"warm"},{"id":"reader","label":"读者浏览器","tone":"teal"}],"steps":[{"from":"you","to":"showai","label":"准备发布","kind":"call","detail":"`publish prepare`（或 MCP `publication_prepare`）生成 `manifest.json`、说明元数据和包含完整依赖的 `bundle.json`，文件路径带内容的 SHA-256 摘要。这一步只写本地文件。"},{"from":"you","to":"host","label":"上传发布目录","kind":"call","detail":"上传到你自己选择的静态托管。ShowAI 不会替你上传。读者的浏览器需要能跨域读取这些文件。"},{"from":"you","to":"showai","label":"用网址校验","kind":"call","detail":"`publish verify --url MANIFEST_URL`。只绑定单个项目的 MCP 连接不能登记发布，需要用 CLI 完成。"},{"from":"showai","to":"host","label":"下载清单和所有包","kind":"call"},{"from":"host","to":"showai","label":"返回文件","kind":"reply"},{"from":"showai","to":"showai","label":"逐项核对","kind":"note","detail":"检查字节数、传输摘要、包指纹和依赖完整性。**全部通过后**才安装到「已发布」并保存网址校验记录。每次校验的传输预算为 512 MiB，单个发布包最多 256 MiB。"},{"from":"you","to":"showai","label":"引用已发布组件导出","kind":"call","detail":"只接受有本地校验记录的精确版本，不会悄悄换成更新的版本。"},{"from":"reader","to":"host","label":"打开网页，下载组件","kind":"call","detail":"页面显示“正在校验并加载已发布的固定版本组件…”。"},{"from":"host","to":"reader","label":"校验通过后显示","kind":"reply","detail":"SHA-256 或字节数不一致时拒绝加载并说明是哪个组件；网络或跨域设置有问题时提示检查网络和 CORS。完整性校验需要 HTTPS 或在本机打开页面。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-54ea7e21b2eb7835fb0ba41ca4d48f1ab21bc27b88b7f8fa2b03d3b910b05e76"},"id":"node-8cfde432"